<title>ITALY: Italy Impregilo, Hungary's Polus in accord.</title>
<headline>Italy Impregilo, Hungary's Polus in accord.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian constructor Impregilo said in a statement it had signed a framework accord with Hungarian group Polus Invest Rt to set up jointly a company to promote building projects in Hungary and Slovakia.</p>
<p>Impregilo said in the accord with Polus, which is one of the biggest Hungarian operators in the promotion and construction of commercial centres, both companies made available their capacity and experience for promoting public and private building projects and finding financial resources.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
